    ("Which white blood cells differentiate into antibody-secreting plasma cells?", "B lymphocytes (B cells)", ["Natural killer cells", "Cytotoxic T cells", "Eosinophils"], "Clonal selection amplifies B cells specific to a pathogen's antigens."),
    ("What type of antibody class (immunoglobulin) is the most abundant in human blood serum and crosses the placenta?", "IgG", ["IgM", "IgA", "IgE"], "IgG provides passive maternal immunity to newborns and long-term memory protection."),
    ("What type of immunoglobulin primarily guards mucosal surfaces like saliva, tears, and gut secretions?", "IgA", ["IgG", "IgE", "IgD"], "Dimeric secretory IgA prevents pathogen adhesion along mucous membranes."),
    ("What evolutionary process produces similar adaptations independently in unrelated lineages (e.g., shark vs. dolphin fins)?", "Convergent evolution", ["Divergent evolution", "Adaptive radiation", "Genetic drift"], "Analogous structures arise from similar environmental selective pressures."),
    ("What evolutionary phenomenon reduces genetic diversity when a small subgroup establishes an isolated new colony?", "Founder effect", ["Gene flow", "Balancing selection", "Disruptive selection"], "A form of genetic drift common on islands and isolated human populations."),
    ("What plant adaptation separates light capture in mesophyll cells from the Calvin cycle in bundle-sheath cells to curb photorespiration?", "C4 photosynthesis", ["CAM photosynthesis", "C3 photosynthesis", "Cyclic photophosphorylation"], "Used by maize, sugarcane, and sorghum in hot, bright climates."),
    ("What desert plant strategy (used by cacti and pineapples) opens stomata only at night to store CO2 as malate?", "CAM photosynthesis", ["C4 photosynthesis", "C3 photosynthesis", "Photorespiration"], "Crassulacean Acid Metabolism minimizes daytime evaporative water loss."),
    ("Which marine mammal sonar-imaging structure sits inside a dolphin's forehead to focus echolocation clicks?", "The melon", ["Baleen plate", "Spermaceti sac", "Ampullae of Lorenzini"], "Lipid layers of differing acoustic velocity act as an acoustic lens."),
    ("Which electroreceptive organs allow sharks and rays to sense faint muscle bioelectric fields of buried prey?", "Ampullae of Lorenzini", ["Lateral line", "Otoliths", "Statocysts"], "Jelly-filled pores across the snout detect nanovolt electric gradients."),
    ("Which class of inorganic solid-state materials conducts electricity with zero resistance and high Tc above 77 K (liquid nitrogen)?", "Cuprate high-Tc superconductors (e.g., YBCO)", ["Type-I elemental metals", "Silicon carbides", "Piezoceramics"], "Bednorz and Müller's 1986 discovery opened superconducting ceramics above boiling nitrogen."),
    ("Which thermodynamic relation links equilibrium vapor pressure slope dP/dT to latent heat and volume change?", "Clausius-Clapeyron equation", ["Gibbs-Duhem equation", "Van 't Hoff equation", "Dalton's law"], "Explains why water boils at lower temperatures on high mountain peaks."),
    ("Which mathematical theorem in signal processing states a band-limited signal requires sampling faster than twice its max frequency?", "Nyquist-Shannon sampling theorem", ["Parseval's theorem", "Fourier uncertainty", "Wiener-Khinchin theorem"], "Undersampling below 2*f_max produces aliasing artifacts."),
    ("Which crystalline defect occurs when an ion leaves its normal lattice site and occupies an interstitial void?", "Frenkel defect", ["Schottky defect", "Screw dislocation", "Grain boundary"], "Common in silver halides where cations are much smaller than anions."),
    ("Which astrophysical nuclear process rapidly captures neutrons in neutron-star mergers to forge gold and platinum?", "r-process (Rapid neutron capture)", ["s-process", "CNO cycle", "Triple-alpha process"], "Confirmed by gravitational-wave kilonova observations in GW170817 (2017)."),
    ("Which stellar nuclear fusion step converts three helium-4 nuclei into one carbon-12 nucleus in red giants?", "Triple-alpha process", ["Proton-proton chain", "CNO cycle", "Alpha ladder"], "Predicted by Fred Hoyle via an excited resonant state of Carbon-12."),
    ("Which solar neutrino experiment in a South Dakota gold mine first revealed the 'solar neutrino problem' (resolved by flavor oscillation)?", "Homestake experiment", ["Super-Kamiokande", "Sudbury Neutrino Observatory", "IceCube"], "Ray Davis detected only a third of expected electron neutrinos, later explained by neutrino oscillation."),
    ("What quantum-mechanical effect in 2D electron gases under strong magnetic fields quantizes Hall resistance to h/(νe²)?", "Quantum Hall effect", ["Spin-orbit coupling", "Anderson localization", "Kondo effect"], "Discovered by Klaus von Klitzing in 1980, providing an ultra-precise resistance standard."),
    ("What phenomenon freezes electron transport in disordered solids due to wave interference of scattered paths?", "Anderson localization", ["Bloch oscillation", "Peierls instability", "Mott transition"], "Predicted by Philip W. Anderson in 1958."),
    ("What phase transition transforms a material predicted by band theory to be metallic into an insulator via strong electron-electron repulsion?", "Mott insulator transition", ["Peierls transition", "Jahn-Teller distortion", "Kosterlitz-Thouless transition"], "Explains why NiO is an insulator despite partially filled d-orbitals."),
    ("Which astronomical distance-ladder anomaly arises because CMB early-universe fits (~67 km/s/Mpc) differ from local Cepheid measurements (~73 km/s/Mpc)?", "Hubble tension", ["Olbers' paradox", "Dark flow", "Axis of Evil anomaly"], "Remains one of modern cosmology's most actively studied open puzzles."),
